@startuml fig-3-6-freshness-state-machine
!include theme/waspada-report.theme.puml
top to bottom direction

[*] --> current : version published
current --> needs_update : review_due_at passed,\nor source report withdrawn
needs_update --> current : new applicable\nevidence evaluated
current --> expired : issuer validity ended
needs_update --> expired : issuer validity ended
expired --> current : new applicable\nevidence evaluated

note right of expired
  Only the issuer's validity window
  sets expired. Expired never means
  resolved, safe or no longer relevant.
end note
@enduml
